[node name="ValleyCharter" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-300, -430)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Charter"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The Charter of Thornhaven[/b]

Behind glass gone yellow with smoke hangs the village charter. The freeholders of Thornhaven hold their fields 'of House Ashdown, by deed, for so long as they keep the peace and render their due.'

The Ashdown seal is a tower over a river. Someone has lately underlined 'keep the peace' in fresh ink, hard enough to dent the parchment."
reexamine_text = "'For so long as they keep the peace.' The fresh ink under those words has not faded."

