[node name="CouncillorsNotes" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(250, -262)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Papers"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Papers left on a councillor's chair[/b]

Two notes of debt, both in Gregor's neat merchant's script. Seed grain on credit, a roof mended, a dowry advanced. Each signed with a councillor's mark, and each with the same line at the foot: 'No interest asked between friends.'

Two of the five chairs at this table owe the merchant more than they could repay."
reexamine_text = "Two councillors, two debts to Gregor. 'No interest asked between friends.'"

